				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6815a16702d3d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6815a16702d3d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p class="metasyncPara">The Florida Atlantic Owls shocked the basketball world with their 2023 Final Four run, marking a historic moment for a mid-major program turned national contender. The Owls’ disciplined defense, rapid offense, and innovative coaching strategies prompted surprising upsets and elevated expectations across the nation.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6815a16702d5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6815a16702d5f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p class="metasyncPara">Statistical analyses of mid-major tournaments indicate that breakthrough programs like the FAU Owls can see a 20% increase in fan engagement and recruiting strength after an unexpected deep tournament run. FAU’s Cinderella story is a model of resilience and underdog success, proving that strategic vision and resourceful management can bridge the gap between expectation and excellence.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6815a16702d68 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6815a16702d68" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p class="metasyncPara">This transformative journey is reminiscent of Midwest Tropical’s evolution over nearly 50 years—continually adapting, innovating, and leaving a mark on its industry through stellar <b>design</b> and unmatched quality.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6815a16702d71 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6815a16702d71" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Comparison Table: Key Attributes of Florida’s Top Basketball Teams</h2>				</div>
